Iran's IRGC says two oil tankers in the Strait of Hormuz were stopped and are currently burning.

"One of these vessels, a supertanker, collided with a naval mine and exploded. The second tanker, which was under the protection of U.S. military fighter jets and was attempting to secretly pass through an illegal route, also experienced an incident and was stopped, engulfed in a massive fire." adds the statement.
